        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Natalie Martinez, Paul W. S. Anderson, Jason Statham, Jason Clarke, Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Moisés Arias, Rafi Gavron, Ezri Walker, Kim Coates, Linda Emond, Machine Gun Kelly, Erykah Badu, Michael K. Williams, Jennifer Lopez\n- Films: Death Race, The Land, Public Enemies, Zero Dark Thirty, White House Down, Dawn of the Planet of the Apes, Terminator Genisys, Everest\n- Products: JLO by Jennifer Lopez\n\nFacts:\n- Natalie Martinez was born on July 12, 1984, and she is an American actress and model.\n- Natalie Martinez was the spokes-model for JLO by Jennifer Lopez.\n- Death Race is a 2008 American-German-British science fiction action thriller film produced, written, and directed by Paul W. S. Anderson and starring Jason Statham.\n- Natalie Martinez is known for a role in the 2008 feature film Death Race.\n- Jason Clarke had a film role in Death Race in 2008.\n- Jason Clarke had film roles in Public Enemies in 2009, Zero Dark Thirty and White House Down in 2013, Dawn of the Planet of the Apes in 2014, and Terminator Genisys and Everest in 2015.\n- The 2016 film The Land stars Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Moisés Arias, Rafi Gavron, Ezri Walker, Kim Coates, Linda Emond, Natalie Martinez, Machine Gun Kelly, Erykah Badu, and Michael K. Williams.",
